WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Medium Hazanshu approaches Ryu with the overhead flip.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.600
Hazanshu connects as a Punish Counter.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.500
Crouching medium punch follows while Chun-Li holds down.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.850
Heavy Spinning Bird Kick connects from the down charge.

5
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:04.950
Ryu recovers after the SBK ender.
